WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.107
Crack!

2
00:00:03.108 --> 00:00:07.909
Roxy dove out of the way just as the lightning bolt struck a mailbox.

3
00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:10.826
"Whew!" Roxy took a deep breath.

4
00:00:10.827 --> 00:00:12.667
"That was a close—"

5
00:00:12.668 --> 00:00:16.115
Crack! Another bolt of lightning struck.

6
00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:20.336
Roxy jumped out of the way again.

7
00:00:20.337 --> 00:00:25.157
"You think you're so quick, Rocket Girl," shouted Weatherman.

8
00:00:25.158 --> 00:00:28.832
"I'd like to see you try to jump away from this!"

9
00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:31.689
Weatherman threw another Weather Ball into the air.

10
00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:36.973
"Weather Ball, activate!" he shouted.

11
00:00:36.974 --> 00:00:41.215
A strong wind blew, throwing Roxy off her feet.

12
00:00:41.216 --> 00:00:43.568
Rain began to pour down.

13
00:00:43.569 --> 00:00:47.484
Crack! Boom! More lightning struck.

14
00:00:47.485 --> 00:00:51.685
Roxy jumped to her feet, dodging bolts of lightning.

15
00:00:51.686 --> 00:00:54.787
"Listen, Weatherman," shouted Roxy.

16
00:00:54.788 --> 00:00:58.780
"Your dumb little thunderstorm isn't going to stop me!"

17
00:00:58.781 --> 00:01:02.043
"Maybe not," said Weatherman with a smirk.

18
00:01:02.044 --> 00:01:04.961
"But I have something that will."

19
00:01:04.962 --> 00:01:07.708
He threw another Weather Ball into the air.

20
00:01:07.709 --> 00:01:10.874
"Weather Ball, activate!"

21
00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:13.388
Roxy felt a change in the air.

22
00:01:13.389 --> 00:01:18.288
There was a rumbling sound, and the wind grew stronger.

23
00:01:18.289 --> 00:01:22.173
"Uh-oh. What's happening now?" Roxy wondered.

24
00:01:22.174 --> 00:01:30.437
And then she saw it—a huge tornado was whipping down West Street.

25
00:01:30.438 --> 00:01:35.427
"Whoa!" Roxy screamed as she was swept upward.

26
00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:38.824
She spun around and around.

27
00:01:38.825 --> 00:01:41.957
"I'm getting dizzy!" she yelled.

28
00:01:41.958 --> 00:01:44.138
Roxy heard voices.

29
00:01:44.139 --> 00:01:46.577
"Help!" a woman shouted.

30
00:01:46.578 --> 00:01:51.175
"Rocket Girl! Save me!" shouted a man.

31
00:01:51.176 --> 00:01:55.553
The tornado had picked up a bus and a taxi along with Roxy.

32
00:01:55.554 --> 00:01:58.112
All the passengers were terrified.

33
00:01:58.113 --> 00:02:00.635
"Oh no!" Roxy thought.

34
00:02:00.636 --> 00:02:04.672
"I have to save those people!"

35
00:02:04.673 --> 00:02:08.545
Roxy used all her strength to fly around the tornado.

36
00:02:08.546 --> 00:02:12.045
She grabbed the taxi with one hand.

37
00:02:12.046 --> 00:02:17.081
"Grr!" Roxy grunted as she flew toward the bus.

38
00:02:17.082 --> 00:02:23.145
"Got it!" she shouted, grabbing hold of the bus.

39
00:02:23.146 --> 00:02:27.035
With her hands full, Roxy flew away from the tornado.

40
00:02:27.036 --> 00:02:30.552
She looked for a safe place to put the vehicles.

41
00:02:30.553 --> 00:02:34.131
As the tornado died down, the police came around a corner.

42
00:02:34.132 --> 00:02:37.560
"There's Weatherman!" shouted one police officer.

43
00:02:37.561 --> 00:02:39.486
"I need a blizzard!"

44
00:02:39.487 --> 00:02:44.014
Weatherman cried, throwing another Weather Ball into the air.

45
00:02:44.015 --> 00:02:45.770
The air grew colder.

46
00:02:45.771 --> 00:02:48.538
A few snowflakes began to fall down.

47
00:02:48.539 --> 00:02:51.350
Then a strong wind whipped along the street.

48
00:02:51.351 --> 00:02:54.940
The snow fell faster, and soon the street was covered.

49
00:02:54.941 --> 00:02:57.805
The police cars skidded through the deep snow.

50
00:02:57.806 --> 00:03:03.147
They slid off the street and onto the sidewalk.

51
00:03:03.148 --> 00:03:06.613
Weatherman got back into his van and pressed a button.

52
00:03:06.614 --> 00:03:13.221
The van's wheels folded in and were replaced with snow treads.

53
00:03:13.222 --> 00:03:19.969
"Ha-ha!" Weatherman cackled and drove away.

